  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An urgent plea to help abused dogs in Egypt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Over the past few years, we have seen a worrying increase in abuse and cruelty against dogs in Egypt, and the victims come to the Animal Protection Foundation (APF) clinic every day. The APF shelter has more than 3000 dogs to care for. With the increasing numbers of dogs rescued and the limited resources, we reached a point where providing the bare necessities of survival has become very difficult. We need your help to keep helping more dogs in need and provide for the dogs under our care.</narrative>
  </description>
